Jyutping follows the Linguistic Society of Hong Kong scheme:

https://jyutping.org/en/jyutping/

In-repo summary (especially §4 tones): `docs/jyutping.md`

- Compact UI: ASCII tone numbers after each syllable (`zou2 san4`)
- Detailed expansions: add Chao tone letters from §4 (`zou2 ˧˥  san4 ˨˩`)
  - 1 ˥ · 2 ˧˥ · 3 ˧ · 4 ˨˩ · 5 ˩˧ · 6 ˨
- Do not superscript the tone numbers
